# Always verify locally before push

Before `git push`, opening a PR, or telling Filip that CI should be green, run the full package suite for every workspace you changed (a single-file run is debugging, not a gate), the build/typecheck CI runs for it, and `npm run lint` at the repo root. Do not push on red. Re-run after the final diff of a session. Cite the exact commands and that they passed in the handoff; no "should be green".

The rules and commands: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#tests).
